Z||000006||Oreif||09-05-2001||08:22 AM||||They don't have emblems. There are a few sites out there with this format. They basically take the dealer parts catalog and put it on-line. If you go to FAQ and click on "Where do the parts come from?",<BR>The answer is regional OEM warehouses. So since GM isn't making the emblems and they are "out of stock", No emblems. If you can't get the part from a dealer you can't get it from these places.||||reg||13
